(TaskRunner pid=[process]) - $A = (a, 0)$: Plug into the equation:
(TaskRunner pid=[process])   $$
(TaskRunner pid=[process])   \frac{a^2}{20} - 0 = 1 \Rightarrow a^2 = 20 \Rightarrow a = \sqrt{20}
(TaskRunner pid=[process])   $$
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) - $B = (0, b)$: Plug into the equation:
(TaskRunner pid=[process])   $$
(TaskRunner pid=[process])   0 - \frac{b^2}{24} = 1 \Rightarrow -\frac{b^2}{24} = 1 \Rightarrow b^2 = -24
