(TaskRunner pid=[process]) Then the two equations become:
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) $$
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) \frac{p^2}{40} - \frac{q^2}{48} = 1 \tag{1}
