(TaskRunner pid=[process]) ---
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) ### Step 3: Use the Geometry of the Rhombus
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) Since $ABCD$ is a **rhombus**, the **sides** are equal in length.
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) So:
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) $$
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) AB = BC = CD = DA
