(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) But since the diagonals are perpendicular and bisect each other, and the diagonals are $AC$ and $BD$, we can use the **distance formula** to express the side length in terms of the coordinates.
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) Let’s compute $AB^2$:
(TaskRunner pid=[process]) 
